      "limits": "Lam-Leung necessity, irreducibility of prime polygons, and full root-of-unity groups of cyclotomic fields are classical premises; verifier recomputation checks arithmetic bindings but does not prove those theorems. Finite controls and explicit budget refusal do not imply broad physical/genesis claims."
