          ]
        }
      ],
      "limits": "Independent mask model,127 polynomials degree<=6:23 false admissions including the constant1 case. Standard first-irreducible search starts odd and valid degrees1..4 retained sound bounded arithmetic checks. No source execution."
    },
    {
      "id": "RFA-F003",
      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "Public field elements are not admitted to their carrier",
      "statement": "FieldElement.coeffs is public; even a searched valid GF4 accepts [] beside [1,0], with add returning [] by zip and trace_value subsequently indexing an empty sum. Longer vectors can index past product. No length, coefficient range or field identity is checked.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "path": "code/rust/core_number_theory/src/finite_field.rs",
