    {
      "id": "RFA-F011",
      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "Public refinement does not establish root record properties",
      "statement": "RootLocation::Isolated is documented as a unique irrational root, yet refine_simple_root(2x-1,[0,1],tolerance1) returns Isolated without bisection although its unique root1/2 is rational. With an untrusted interval, x^3-x over[-2,2] and tolerance4 passes the sole sign-change gate despite three roots. refine_root also copies a public Exact(123), multiplicity0 record unchanged for x²-2.",
      "evidence": [
